You will be given a podcast transcript and a question asked during the podcast (delimited by XML tags). Find the EXACT passage of the transcript that directly answers the question. If you find a clear answer, return it VERBATIM after the prefix "Answer: ". The answer may span many sentences but it must come after the question and be a single unbroken passage with no jumps. If no clear answer is found, return "N/A" after the prefix.
